      "id": "task",
      "score": 3,
      "reason": "文章回答了題目，描述了週末活動並解釋喜歡的原因（\"weekend is still my favorite time because I can relax\"），但細節與原因發展較簡單，語氣不夠自然。"
    },
    {
      "id": "organization",
      "score": 3,
      "reason": "有段落區分（早上、下午、星期日晚上），但段內連接詞與句子銜接不夠流暢，像是獨立句 \"Because I am very tired in school.\" 無法緊密接上前句。"
    },
    {
      "id": "vocabulary",
      "score": 3,
      "reason": "用字簡單且能表達意思（例如 \"night market\", \"bubble tea\"），但出現不正確或不自然的用詞如 \"eat many thing\"、\"very hot noisy\"。"
    },
    {
      "id": "grammar",
      "score": 2,
      "reason": "多處文法錯誤與動詞形式問題（如 \"I always sleep\", \"my mother cook\", \"we play two or three hour\", \"I must doing homework\"），句型變化有限。"
    }
  ],
  "issues": [
    {
      "quote": "In weekend I always sleep until 11 oclock.",
      "type": "preposition",
      "why": "固定片語應為 \"on the weekend\" 或 \"At the weekend\"，且時間寫法需更自然（\"11 o'clock\"）。",
      "suggestion": "On weekends I usually sleep until 11 o'clock."
    },
    {
      "quote": "Because I am very tired in school.",
      "type": "sentence",
      "why": "以 Because 開頭的片句未接完整主句，造成片段句；應合併到前一句或改為完整句子。",
      "suggestion": "I am very tired from school."
    },
    {
      "quote": "my mother cook very delicious food.",
      "type": "verb",
      "why": "動詞未依主語變化，現在簡單式第三人稱單數需加 -s（cook -> cooks）。",
      "suggestion": "my mother cooks very delicious food."
    }
  ],
  "more": [
    {
      "quote": "we play two or three hour.",
      "type": "grammar",
      "why": "名詞複數與數量搭配錯誤，應為 \"hours\"，並用更自然的表達如 \"for two or three hours\"。",
      "suggestion": "we play for two or three hours."
    },
    {
      "quote": "Sometime we go to the night market and eat many thing, like chicken and bubble tea.",
      "type": "word-choice",
      "why": "\"Sometime\" 應為複數 \"Sometimes\"，\"many thing\" 應為可數複數或更自然的表達如 \"many things\" 或 \"a lot of food\"。",
      "suggestion": "Sometimes we go to the night market and eat many things, like chicken and bubble tea."
    },
    {
      "quote": "I very like night market because it have many people and is very hot noisy.",
      "type": "grammar",
      "why": "語序和動詞不正確（\"I very like\" 不自然），且主詞動詞不一致（\"it have\" 應為 \"it has\"）；形容詞使用也需調整（\"hot noisy\" 應用副詞或兩個形容詞並列）。",
      "suggestion": "I really like the night market because it has many people and is very noisy."
    },
    {
      "quote": "Sunday night I must doing homework, it make me unhappy.",
      "type": "verb",
      "why": "\"must doing\" 是錯誤結構；在情態動詞後應接原形動詞（do），且兩個獨立子句應用連接詞或分號分開。\"it make me unhappy\" 動詞也需加 s。\"",
      "suggestion": "On Sunday night I must do homework; it makes me unhappy."
    },
    {
      "quote": "But weekend is still my favorite time because I can relax and no need to study.",
      "type": "grammar",
      "why": "\"weekend\" 前應加定冠詞或以複數表達（\"the weekend\" 或 \"weekends\"），且 \"no need to study\" 應改為完整結構如 \"I don't need to study\"。",
      "suggestion": "But the weekend is still my favorite time because I can relax and don't need to study."
    }
  ],
  "strengths": [
    {
      "quote": "I eat breakfast with my family",
      "why": "能表達家庭活動這類細節，讓內容更有生活氣息，對話題相關性高。"
    },
    {
      "quote": "Sometimes we go to the night market and eat many thing, like chicken and bubble tea.",
      "why": "提到具體活動與食物（night market, bubble tea），增加了文化與內容的可讀性。"
    }
  ],
  "summary": "繼續練習基本語法（主詞與動詞的一致、情態動詞後接原形）和常見片語（on weekends, in the afternoon）。多注意句子連接，將片段句合併為完整句。下次寫作時試著用更多連接詞和正確時態，內容就會更流暢自然。"
}
